class=\"lang-zh\">观测与几何</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Observations and geometry</span></div><div class=\"circuit-desc\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">明确投影数量、角度、尺度与坐标。</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Specify projection count, angles, scale and coordinates.</span></div></div></div><div class=\"circuit-node \" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"冻结先验与报告\" data-node-name-en=\"Frozen prior and report\" data-node-desc=\"预训练权重与文本条件属于额外信息。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Weights and text are explicit additional inputs.\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_138_phydict',1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><div class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">冻结先验与报告</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Frozen prior and report</span></div><div class=\"circuit-desc\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">预训练权重与文本条件属于额外信息。</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Weights and text are explicit additional inputs.</span></div></div></div><div class=\"circuit-node \" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"引导采样\" data-node-name-en=\"Guided sampling\" data-node-desc=\"交替去噪和投影约束。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Alternate denoising and projection consistency.\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_138_phydict',2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><div class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">引导采样</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Guided sampling</span></div><div class=\"circuit-desc\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">交替去噪和投影约束。</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Alternate denoising and projection consistency.</span></div></div></div><div class=\"circuit-node \" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"验证\" data-node-name-en=\"Validation\" data-node-desc=\"分别检查观测一致性与三维准确性。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Assess measurement agreement and 3D fidelity separately.\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_138_phydict',3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><div class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">验证</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Validation</span></div><div class=\"circuit-desc\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">分别检查观测一致性与三维准确性。</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Assess measurement agreement and 3D fidelity separately.</span></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"spec-evo-matrix\"><section class=\"spec-matrix-cell\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">上一代瓶颈</div><ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">少量投影无法唯一确定患者三维结构；通用生成先验可能与实际观测不一致。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Sparse projections leave unresolved depth; a generative prior may be inconsistent with the observations.</li></ul></section><section class=\"spec-matrix-cell\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">核心想法</div><ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">把冻结的三维先验与可微成像观测结合，在推理阶段约束候选体。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Constrain a frozen 3D prior with the differentiable image-formation model at inference.</li></ul></section><section class=\"spec-matrix-cell\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">关键改进</div><ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">作者方案使用 Split Gibbs 思路引导采样，并提供额外计算细化。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">The author method uses Split Gibbs guidance and an extra-compute refinement stage.</li></ul></section><section class=\"spec-matrix-cell\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">医学适配</div><ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">论文针对肺 CT 和合成 X 光重建；文本条件不是免费获得的信息。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">The paper studies lung CT with simulated X-rays. Report conditioning must be declared.</li></ul></section><section class=\"spec-matrix-cell\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">适用范围与证据</div><ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">本条为 source_route：已核原始源码和根许可证；未执行原模型、未验证临床效果。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Source route only: official source and root license checked; original inference and clinical performance were not tested here.</li></ul></section></div><footer class=\"spec-footer-bar\"><div class=\"spec-footer-cell\"><span class=\"footer-kicker\">PRIMARY LITERATURE</span><a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://papers.miccai.org/miccai-2026/0773-Paper1942.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">PhyDiCT: Plug-and-Play CT Reconstruction from Sparse X-Rays via Differentiable Rendering and Strong Priors ↗</a></div><div class=\"spec-footer-cell\"><span class=\"footer-kicker\">MODEL WORKSPACE</span><a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"models/phydict/\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">原图、机制与来源</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Figure, mechanism and sources</span> ↗</a></div></footer></div>"}